# Neighbors 1: bulkheads split capacity (isolation), which is not shedding. Google SRE book ch. 22; Netflix concurrency-limits README; term: Azure "Bulkhead pattern".
...@_style
grid-columns: 1
grid-gap: 14
a: "Google's suggestion\ncap any one client at 25% of threads" {class: svc}
